<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<h1>Privacy &amp; Number Masking</h1>
<p class="tl-subtitle">
    When enabled, customer phone numbers are masked (e.g. <code>98******45</code>) on the
    corresponding screens — and stripped server-side, so the raw number is never sent to that
    browser at all. Every call still keeps its own unique ID visible everywhere, so agents and
    supervisors can always match a masked call to its recording and other records.
</p>
<div class="tl-grid">
    <div class="tl-card">
        <div class="tl-kpi-label">Mask customer numbers for Agents</div>
        <p class="tl-subtitle">Applies to the Agent Workspace and "My Calls".</p>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/privacy-settings/toggle">
            <input type="hidden" name="field" value="agents">
            <input type="hidden" name="enabled" value="<%= settings.mask_number_for_agents ? '0' : '1' %>">
            <button class="tl-btn <%= settings.mask_number_for_agents ? '' : 'secondary' %>" type="submit">
                <%= settings.mask_number_for_agents ? 'Masking ON — click to disable' : 'Masking OFF — click to enable' %>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-card">
        <div class="tl-kpi-label">Mask customer numbers for Supervisors</div>
        <p class="tl-subtitle">Applies to Call Records and CDR export/download.</p>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/privacy-settings/toggle">
            <input type="hidden" name="field" value="supervisors">
            <input type="hidden" name="enabled" value="<%= settings.mask_number_for_supervisors ? '0' : '1' %>">
            <button class="tl-btn <%= settings.mask_number_for_supervisors ? '' : 'secondary' %>" type="submit">
                <%= settings.mask_number_for_supervisors ? 'Masking ON — click to disable' : 'Masking OFF — click to enable' %>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
